cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."

title: "IVERT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/continuous-dems/ivert"
abstract: >-
  IVERT (ICESat-2 Validation of Elevations Reporting Tool) validates Digital
  Elevation Models by comparing their elevations against ICESat-2 satellite
  photon data. It supports topographic, bathymetric, and mixed coastal DEMs,
  runs fully offline, and handles vertical datum conversions automatically.

version: "0.6.9"
date-released: "2026-08-27"

type: "software"
license: "MIT"
keywords:
  - "Python"
  - "DEM"
  - "ICESat-2"
  - "Altimetry"
  - "Bathymetry"

